Subject: [PATCH 245/784] soh: rename func_80041EA4 ->
 SurfaceType_GetFloorProperty

Name source: zeldaret/oot (same decomp, same ROM address).
Body verified against upstream at 1.00.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_bgcheck.c.
---
 soh/include/functions.h                             | 2 +-
 soh/soh/Enhancements/ExtraModes/EnemyRandomizer.cpp | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_bgcheck.c                            | 3 ++-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Test/z_en_test.c     | 2 +-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_player_actor/z_player.c | 2 +-
 5 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index 425cc33ac..cb5989357 100644
--- a/soh/include/functions.h
+++ b/soh/include/functions.h
@@ -688,7 +688,7 @@ s32 SurfaceType_CheckWallFlag0(CollisionContext* colCtx, CollisionPoly* poly, s3
 s32 SurfaceType_CheckWallFlag1(CollisionContext* colCtx, CollisionPoly* poly, s32 bgId);  // was func_80041E18 [oot]
